 rice: Free\nCategories: community\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n
 \nJoin us for a free screening of Bridging Our Stories \, an award-winning
  documentary about a Filipina in Ketchikan\, Alaska who traveled to the Ph
 ilippines to learn indigenous dances and bring them home to the next gener
 ation. Afterward\, meet director Rafael Bitanga for a Q&A\, try tayo (a fr
 ee AI life coaching tool for young adults)\, and hear two-minute lightning
  shares from Filipino creators\, builders\, and founders. Merienda provide
 d. Sunday\, Dec 6\, 1 to 3 PM (doors 12:30 PM) at TEL HI Gym\, 555 Chestnu
 t St\, San Francisco. Free\, RSVP required. Presented by Bridging Our Stor
 ies (Bitanga Productions) and tayo\, with community partners TEL HI and YF
 PA.
