BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Merry Shipmas: Free Christmas AI Hackathon (San Francisco)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T180000
DTSTAMP:20261127T160306Z
UID:funcheap-20261212-merryshipmasfreechristma
CATEGORIES:ai,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/merry-shipmas-free-christmas-ai-hackat
 hon-san-francisco/\nVenue: goes out to registered guests. More at merryshi
 pmas.com\nPrice: Free\nCategories: ai\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francis
 co\n\nMerry Shipmas is a free Christmas AI hackathon by NERDCONF. The ques
 tion is simple: what will you ship before Christmas? The San Francisco day
  is Saturday\, December 12\, from 10am to 6pm. Come build with AI next to 
 other builders\, get help from mentors and sponsor teams\, and leave with 
 something real that people can use. You can come solo or bring a team. Aft
 er the in-person day\, the hackathon keeps going online until December 19.
  The goal is to find your first users in a week\, not just to demo. Sponso
 rs include OpenAI\, Lovable and Nebius. Last season\, our Halloween hackat
 hon Stranger Builds had 1\,280+ builders sign up and 100+ projects shipped
 . Free to attend. RSVP is required on Luma\, and the exact venue goes out 
 to registered guests. More at merryshipmas.com
LOCATION:goes out to registered guests. More at merryshipmas.com
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/merry-shipmas-free-christmas-ai-hackathon-san-
 francisco/
END:VEVENT
